foreign-engine-dialog-title = Non-Starlight game engine
foreign-engine-dialog-body = Engine { $version } is not published on the { $preferred } CDN yet, so the launcher would download the regular engine from { $cdn } instead.
foreign-engine-dialog-hint =
    The regular engine has no Discord or Steam login. On Starlight servers you will most likely be refused with "This server requires authentication.", or join as your SS14 account without your Discord progress.
    If this server just updated, wait until the Starlight engine build is out, or let the server staff know.
foreign-engine-dialog-cancel = Cancel
foreign-engine-dialog-confirm = Continue anyway
